define('group-detail','分组详情','organize','执行顺序可拖动调整；上下按钮用于桌面预览与键盘操作。移出分组不删除任务。',()=>screen(`<div class="summary"><span class="app-icon">${icon('folder')}</span><div><h3>${esc(state.groupName)}</h3><p>${state.members.length} 个任务 · 按列表顺序执行</p></div></div>${note('长按任务图标拖动排序；左滑仅移出当前分组。')}${state.variant==='空白'||!state.members.length?empty('这个分组，等待第一位成员','从已有任务中选择，组成你的日常流程。','folder','添加任务','add-members'):`${section('执行顺序','更改自动保存')}<div class="task-list">${state.members.map((id,i)=>{let t=tasks[id];return t?`<div class="reorder-row">${taskRow({...t,desc:`第 ${i+1} 个执行`,tag:''},id,{reorder:true,number:i+1})}<div class="reorder-actions"><button data-action="move:${i}:-1" aria-label="上移 ${esc(t.name)}" ${i===0?'disabled':''}>↑</button><button data-action="move:${i}:1" aria-label="下移 ${esc(t.name)}" ${i===state.members.length-1?'disabled':''}>↓</button><button data-action="removeMember:${id}" aria-label="移出 ${esc(t.name)}">×</button></div></div>`:'';}).join('')}</div>`}`,{title:'分组详情',subtitle:'任务空间 / 分组',actions:ib('plus','navigate:add-members','添加任务')+ib('more','modal:groupMenu','分组操作'),footer:go('在悬浮面板中执行','float-group','primary','play')}),['add-members','float-group','groups'],['默认','空白']);
